# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The ONE source of truth for the site origin.
#
# Everything derives from this: metadataBase, canonical, og:url, og:image,
# twitter card URLs, JSON-LD, sitemap.xml and robots.txt. No origin is
# hardcoded anywhere else in the codebase.
#
# No trailing slash. Must include the scheme.
#
# CUTOVER: while rafidazhar.dev is not yet purchased and resolving, this stays
# pointed at the live GitHub Pages origin so no dead canonical is advertised to
# crawlers. Moving to the new domain is this one line, then rebuild.
#
#   Today:       https://rafidef.github.io
#   After DNS:   https://rafidazhar.dev
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://rafidef.github.io
